    "body": "Correction to the audit above, row \"Pick-through, when on, picks it\": that is met in the API only (`PickQuery::through`, pinned by `feature_pick::pick_through_does_pick_the_far_side_edge`). The issue asks for a pick-through mode the USER can turn on, off by default and shown as such; the viewport offers no such control and always sends `through: false` (`crates/ui/src/feature_click.rs` `query_at`). So it is **still owed** on #692, beside the circle/arc centre picks (wait for #759) and the maintainer's hand GUI check. PR #863 does not deliver it and says `Refs #692`.",
